OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening to come with plenty of late
OL,7,Fsunshine, followed by a dry and clear
OL,8,Fnight. Some patchy mist or fog
OL,9,Fpossible by dawn. Feeling cool
OL,10,Fparticularly in rural areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA dry day on Sunday and
OL,13,Ffeeling very warm in the sunny spells.
OL,14,FSome patchy cloud developing in the
OL,15,Fafternoon, but still plenty of
OL,16,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
